When you hit a monster with a potion of invisibility, it seems to stay invisible
forever.  I did this to a nymph, and she stole me blind, even when I could "see"
:-).  I think that if you hit a monster with a potion, its effects should be 
temporary, like it is for you.  I was playing Unix NetHack Version 3.0g 
Patchlevel 5.

